5	//
6	// Kinds (schema ophanim.work/v1), each re-derived on append and on every verify:
7	//   work.intake   a source of work seen by reconciliation: a status item, a published issue, a ticket. An issue
8	//                 with no ledger item is a CANDIDATE: it is recorded, never executed, until the owner adds an item.
